      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "value": "\n<ol><li dir=\"ltr\">By the name of our Cr[eator].\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">On the sixth of the week, in the month of Elul, thirteen days therein [... year four]\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">thousand, seven hundred, and ninety-four A.[M. ...]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...] \"I, Japheth b. Abraham, declare intentionally, wil[lingly ... not]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[enti]ced, nor intoxicated, rather with full faculties and complete will to m[arry...]\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...] and provide for, clothe, esteem and honor Na\u1e93ar dau[ghter of\u00a0 ...\" She accepted and agreed]\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[... t]o serve, attend, honor, and [esteem ... She became his wife]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[a]s he had desired and requested. They fixed [as the marriage payment ...]\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...] dinars, and there remain incumbent up[on him a debt of ... She brought in from the house of her fathers]\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...] two skullcaps\u2014dina[rs ...]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...] two ...\u2014di[nar ...]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">...\u00a0 </li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
